# Dea/L1 API Reference

*{% include 'tagline.txt.j2' %}*

Generated API reference for the Dea/L1 codebase.

This document is built from source comments and docstrings for:


- Canonical compiler sources written in L0 under `compiler/src/`


- Shared L1 standard library modules under `compiler/shared/l1/stdlib/`
- Shared runtime API headers under `compiler/shared/runtime/include/`
- Shared native implementation support under `compiler/support/`

Design documents and project documentation are stored in the repository's `docs` directory and are not duplicated in
this reference manual.

## About

- Project: Dea/L1, level one of the Dea systems programming language, compiling through C to native executables.
- Source repository: [github.com/dea-lang/dea](https://github.com/dea-lang/dea).
- Created and maintained by `gwz` ([\@googlielmo](https://github.com/googlielmo)).

## Overview

This reference provides indexed access to the API by directory, namespace, class, and file. Detailed documentation for
each entity is provided in the corresponding sections.
